elivolo che li porta in salvo non c'è posto per gli otto husky. Shepard accetta di separarsi dalla muta a patto che questa venga recuperata in un secondo viaggio, ma il tempo peggiora ulteriormente e i cani restano abbandonati tra i ghiacci...","tagline":"La più incredibile storia di sopravvivenza, amicizia e avventura mai raccontata."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Eight Below","overview":"In the Antarctic, after an expedition with Dr. Davis McClaren, the sled dog trainer Jerry Shepherd has to leave the polar base with his colleagues due to the proximity of a heavy snow storm. He ties his dogs to be rescued after, but the mission is called-off and the dogs are left alone at their own fortune. For six months, Jerry tries to find a sponsor for a rescue mission.","tagline":"The Most Amazing Story Of Survival, Friendship, And Adventure Ever Told."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vWCzRDkjZbRnWskuE2dvAoYGmle.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1GAEBLa8EmA9d8l0s8gHB2zxWLq.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":9036,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vWCzRDkjZbRnWskuE2dvAoYGmle.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vWCzRDkjZbRnWskuE2dvAoYGmle.jpg","language":"it","width":681,"height":1020},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vWCzRDkjZbRnWskuE2dvAoYGmle.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vWCzRDkjZbRnWskuE2dvAoYGmle.jpg","language":"it","width":681,"height":1020},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7FXCz5DRgc8V8u0Oz6HMr6FCEON.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7FXCz5DRgc8V8u0Oz6HMr6FCEON.jpg","language":"it","width":700,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fxxTJudctuBVm7